<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Sept gold output falls to 39.56 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African Sept gold output falls to 39.56 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output fell in September to 39,559.1 kg from August's 41,208.8, Chamber of Mines figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets) -</p>
<p>Sep 1996     Aug 1996     Sep 1995    Jan-Sep 96   Jan-Sep 95</p>
<p>39,559.1     41,208.8     43,753.2    367,843.8    390,569.7</p>
<p>(1.27 mln)   (1.32 mln)   (1.41 mln) (11.83 mln)   (12.56 mln)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
